TD-005 -- TERM-BY-TERM FUEL BUDGET on the CONVERGED dt/4 state

  500 cells, dt = 9.4243e-06 s (D = 0.833). logs/19: the march converges by relaxT 18
  and the steady residual is 8.48e-02, failing C3 (< 0.05) by 1.7x.
